The files in this repository are part of Isekubed, a mod for Minecraft. They are not
licensed for reuse except as follows:

- You may use the files under resourcepack/ to make resource packs for Isekubed.
- You may use the files under translations/ to make translations of Isekubed, and offer
  them back to this repository by pull request. A translation you contribute may be
  shipped with Isekubed.
- You may read, link to and quote the wiki under wiki/.

Third-party works included here keep their own licences. See CREDITS.md and
resourcepack/assets/isekubed/font/ (OFL.txt, UFL.txt, NOTICE.md).
